      `the regional rate of unemployment for Restigouche - Albert, as determined in accordance with subsection 17(1)` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A MAYBE NUMBER
DECIDE `reg 17.1(3) the applicable regional rate for a claimant outside Canada last employed in Madawaska - Charlotte from September 17, 2000 to October 6, 2001` IS
    IF     `reg 17.1 the purpose is section 7, 7.1 or 14 or Part VIII` purpose
       AND `the region in which the claimant, ordinarily resident outside Canada, was last employed in insurable employment in Canada` EQUALS `er1 Madawaska - Charlotte`
